{
  "style": "tactical-vector-maps",
  "version": 1,
  "subject_mode": "ui-first",
  "subject_note": "Mode C, data first. The map is the subject: landmasses, routes, beacons and a dial. Zero people. No flags, no soldiers, no faces. The geography is fictional unless the script sources a real one.",
